          "items": [
            "Home Highlights:<br>- Gulf Views<br>- Private Resort-Style Pool and Spa (Pool can be heated for an additional $50 per day between Oct 1 - May 1)<br>- Elevator<br>- 6 Seater Golf Cart Included<br>- 6 Adult Bicycles Included<br>- New Construction<br>- Short Walk to the Beach<br>-Game Room<br><br>This newly built residence combines modern sophistication with coastal charm, offering an elevated experience for guests seeking both relaxation and style along the shores of Inlet Beach.<br><br>Expansive rooftop gulf views set the backdrop for this property and its views and enjoyment. At the heart of the home, the private resort-style pool and spa invite both tranquil mornings and lively evening gatherings, with the option to heat the pool (during specific times) for year-round enjoyment. Inside, an elevator provides effortless access to every level, while a spacious game room creates opportunities for leisure and entertainment.<br><br>A six-seater golf cart and six adult bicycles are included, making it simple to explore nearby communities. Just a short stroll brings you to the sugar-white sands and turquoise waters of the Gulf, while celebrated dining, boutique shopping, and attractions are only minutes away.<br><br>Whether savoring a sunset from the balcony, sharing a chef-prepared meal, or gathering with loved ones poolside, this home offers the perfect blend of comfort, elegance, and convenience. More than a vacation retreat, it is a sanctuary where memories are made and the beauty of 30A is experienced at its finest.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (Sleeps 29)<br>FIRST FLOOR: <br>•\tKing Bedroom w/ Private Bathroom, Shower Only<br><br>SECOND FLOOR: <br>•\tMaster King Bedroom w/ Private Bathroom, Shower/Tub separate <br>•\tTwo Full over Full Bunkroom w/ Shared Bathroom <br>•\tKing Bedroom w/ Private Bathroom, Shower Only<br>•\tJr Master King Bedroom w/ Private Bathroom, Shower Only<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>•\tTwo Full over Full Bunkroom <br>•\tKing Bedroom w/ Private Bathroom, Shower Only<br>•\tKing Bedroom + Twin w/ Private Bathroom, Shower Only",
